      <li>$80/oz smalls (smaller buds, while supplies last)</li>
      <li>Medical-grade flower only — no adult-use menu</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Confirm current menu, pricing, and hours with the operator before visiting.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>How to Verify Before You Go</h2>
